### ChatMemberUpdated Object

Source: https://docs.aiogram.dev/en/dev-3.x/api/types/chat_member_updated

Represents changes in the status of a chat member. It includes details about the chat, the user performing the action, the date of the change, and the old and new states of the chat member.

```APIDOC
## ChatMemberUpdated Object

### Description
This object represents changes in the status of a chat member.

### Attributes
- **chat** (Chat) - Chat the user belongs to
- **from_user** (User) - Performer of the action, which resulted in the change
- **date** (DateTime) - Date the change was done in Unix time
- **old_chat_member** (ChatMemberUnion) - Previous information about the chat member
- **new_chat_member** (ChatMemberUnion) - New information about the chat member
- **invite_link** (ChatInviteLink | None) - Optional. Chat invite link, which was used by the user to join the chat; for joining by invite link events only.
- **via_join_request** (bool | None) - Optional. `True`, if the user joined the chat after sending a direct join request without using an invite link and being approved by an administrator
- **via_chat_folder_invite_link** (bool | None) - Optional. `True`, if the user joined the chat via a chat folder invite link
```
